@@s063 high (distances between all the pairs)
@@s064 extra result
@@s065 the centres (for the poses: an "average pose" per group)
@@s066 the maxima of the density
@@s067 the hierarchy (dendrogram)
@@s068 In the exercise 1403 sequences of poses are grouped: the centre of a k-means cluster is an average pose, to be interpreted by looking at it. Without labels there is no accuracy: one evaluates with the inertia, the stability, and above all with the sense of the groups found.
@@s069 Q11
@@s070 (a) k-means and mean shift, (b) k-means and agglomerative, (c) k-means and elbow. To bring: the steps of k-means with why it converges and the local minima, the inertia and the elbow, mean shift as climbing towards the density with h, the hierarchy and the linkages, pros and limits compared.
